{"schema": "suborned.mission.adaptive/1", "mission": "handover", "id": "QG2", "style": "prepared-quiet", "note": "Route G as a person plays it, prepared: Watch the guard's marks, Loop the camera, knock him out just after a mark, in, out by the service door, fight from hold, Vale to the car when its mark clears.", "pace": "human", "rules": [{"id": "e-car", "op": "enforcer", "do": "move", "to": "d:Getaway bay"}, {"id": "e-in", "op": "enforcer", "do": "board", "target": "car", "when": ["near:enforcer:d%Getaway bay:3"], "retry": 1}, {"id": "drive", "op": "enforcer", "do": "drive-car", "target": "service-drive", "when": ["fin:e-in"], "retry": 1}, {"id": "enforcer-wait", "op": "enforcer", "do": "move", "to": [5650, -4750], "when": ["since:drive:31"], "retry": 2}, {"id": "tech-to-cabinet", "op": "tech", "do": "move", "to": "cabinet", "run": true}, {"id": "scout-out", "op": "scout", "do": "move", "to": [3800, -5000]}, {"id": "watch-guard", "op": "scout", "do": "watch", "target": "guard", "after": ["scout-out"], "when": ["free:scout"]}, {"id": "loop", "op": "tech", "do": "loop", "target": "entrance", "when": ["t>=:2:10", "free:tech"], "why": "he goes in after 3:00; the tape's 20 s to land and then runs 2:00, past the entry"}, {"id": "beside-guard", "op": "enforcer", "do": "move", "to": [6520, -4110], "when": ["log:loop.on", "t>=:3:00"], "why": "walk in as the mark comes up"}, {"id": "knockout", "op": "enforcer", "do": "takedown", "target": "guard", "how": "knockout", "when": ["t>=:3:02", "t<:3:30", "free:enforcer", "near:enforcer:guard:2.5", "clear:guard:knockout", "nobody:guard:12"], "retry": 0.5, "why": "a passer-by comes by after his 2:30 mark and finds a body left then: wait till the forecourt's clear, with most of the 90 s still to run"}, {"id": "knockout-2", "op": "enforcer", "do": "takedown", "target": "guard", "how": "knockout", "when": ["t>=:3:30", "t<:3:52", "free:enforcer", "near:enforcer:guard:2.5", "clear:guard:knockout"], "unless": ["done:knockout"], "retry": 0.5, "why": "time's going: the card says nobody who'd radio is near, so go"}, {"id": "beside-guard-late", "op": "enforcer", "do": "move", "to": [6520, -4110], "when": ["t>=:3:50"], "unless": ["done:knockout", "done:knockout-2"]}, {"id": "knockout-late", "op": "enforcer", "do": "takedown", "target": "guard", "how": "knockout", "when": ["t>=:4:01", "t<:4:10", "free:enforcer", "near:enforcer:guard:2.5", "clear:guard:knockout"], "unless": ["done:knockout", "done:knockout-2"], "retry": 0.5, "why": "the street wasn't clear after 2:30: the next mark"}, {"id": "enter", "op": "enforcer", "do": "enter", "when": ["log:takedown.out"], "retry": 1}, {"id": "scout-to-rivals", "op": "scout", "do": "move", "to": [8600, -3400], "after": ["watch-guard"], "when": ["log:scout.watch.watched"]}, {"id": "tip", "op": "scout", "do": "mislead", "target": "rivals", "when": ["log:rivals.arrive", "free:scout"], "retry": 3, "why": "when the rivals' car has parked: one fewer in the fight"}, {"id": "draw-all", "op": "scout", "do": "draw", "when": ["log:fight.ambush"], "react": "expected"}, {"id": "draw-fixer", "op": "fixer", "do": "draw", "with": "draw-all"}, {"id": "draw-tech", "op": "tech", "do": "draw", "with": "draw-all"}, {"id": "draw-enforcer", "op": "enforcer", "do": "draw", "with": "draw-all"}, {"id": "focus-blocker-fixer", "op": "fixer", "do": "fire", "target": "$blocker", "when": ["blocker", "done:draw-all"], "retry": 1}, {"id": "focus-blocker-tech", "op": "tech", "do": "fire", "target": "$blocker", "with": "focus-blocker-fixer"}, {"id": "s-y", "op": "scout", "do": "move", "to": [7300, -1900], "run": true, "when": ["log:rivals.misled"]}, {"id": "t-y", "op": "tech", "do": "move", "to": [7300, -1500], "run": true, "when": ["log:enter.in"]}, {"id": "f-y", "op": "fixer", "do": "move", "to": [7300, -1100], "when": ["log:loop.on"]}, {"id": "to-car", "op": "enforcer", "do": "move", "to": [6620, -1500], "when": ["log:enter.out"], "retry": 1}, {"id": "board", "op": "enforcer", "do": "board", "targe